WEBVTT

00:00:25.275 --> 00:00:28.820
Leon! We have to get further back!

00:00:29.571 --> 00:00:31.198
He just doesn't get it sometimes.

00:00:31.657 --> 00:00:34.451
Past trials indicate that
fragments scatter an average of

00:00:34.618 --> 00:00:36.411
a 300-meter radius from the blast zone.

00:00:37.079 --> 00:00:39.414
We've backed up as much as we need to!

00:00:40.165 --> 00:00:42.501
Safe distance from hyperdrive achieved.

00:00:42.834 --> 00:00:43.919
Charging complete.

00:00:44.002 --> 00:00:47.798
Quantum inductor readings, good.
Circuit connection, good.

00:00:48.924 --> 00:00:52.386
April 3rd, 2038, 11:00 a.m.

00:00:52.803 --> 00:00:55.973
Hyperdrive ignition: Test number seven.
Commencing.

00:00:57.849 --> 00:01:01.061
Output, okay. Rotational chaos
and strange attractor synchronized.

00:01:01.144 --> 00:01:02.646
All requirements satisfied.

00:01:13.782 --> 00:01:15.742
Ramanujan analysis value, normal.

00:01:15.826 --> 00:01:17.536
Zero theoretical imperfections.

00:01:17.869 --> 00:01:19.121
This doesn't compute.

00:01:20.622 --> 00:01:23.083
Hyperdrive ignition test seven:

00:01:23.375 --> 00:01:24.835
Failed due to explosion.

00:01:35.012 --> 00:01:36.388
<i>In 2031,</i>

00:01:37.306 --> 00:01:39.683
<i>in an effort to solve</i>
<i>the looming resource shortage,</i>

00:01:39.808 --> 00:01:42.811
<i>the next generation of energy</i>
<i>production was under development.</i>

00:01:42.894 --> 00:01:44.104
<i>The quantum reactor.</i>

00:01:48.442 --> 00:01:49.901
<i>The reactor went haywire</i>

00:01:50.694 --> 00:01:53.071
<i>and triggered evolutionary fields</i>
<i>around the world.</i>

00:01:59.161 --> 00:02:00.871
<i>The environment transformed.</i>

00:02:01.204 --> 00:02:05.709
<i>The flora, fauna, and even AI</i>
<i>underwent peculiar evolutionary changes.</i>

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:09.504
<i>The line between biological</i>
<i>and mechanical became blurred.</i>

00:02:10.631 --> 00:02:11.923
<i>This gave rise</i>

00:02:12.257 --> 00:02:14.593
<i>to uniquely evolved beings called BRAI.</i>

00:02:17.095 --> 00:02:20.474
<i>The BRAI continued to evolve</i>
<i>at an accelerated pace,</i>

00:02:20.932 --> 00:02:23.352
<i>with traits emerging at an alarming rate.</i>

00:02:24.895 --> 00:02:27.689
<i>On the verge of extinction,</i>
<i>the remaining humans</i>

00:02:28.231 --> 00:02:30.400
<i>established final defensive cities.</i>

00:02:31.193 --> 00:02:32.611
<i>In their limited worlds,</i>

00:02:33.028 --> 00:02:35.113
<i>they fought desperately to survive.</i>

00:02:45.123 --> 00:02:47.000
This one's a failure, too.

00:02:47.501 --> 00:02:50.587
The quantum readings from the software
and hardware were all normal.

00:02:50.754 --> 00:02:53.090
Is it still lacking an ignition factor?

00:02:53.382 --> 00:02:54.716
What could it be?

00:03:01.681 --> 00:03:06.269
THE EVOLVING DESTROYER

00:03:11.191 --> 00:03:14.361
-Goddamn it! We're no match!
-That armor is too tough!

00:03:22.577 --> 00:03:25.497
<i>This is the Neo Xianglong control room.</i>
<i>Please respond.</i>

00:03:25.705 --> 00:03:27.082
<i>This is Neo Xianglong.</i>

00:03:27.165 --> 00:03:29.793
<i>Transmission is being disrupted</i>
<i>near the BRAI.</i>

00:03:30.001 --> 00:03:31.711
Rush in the extraction team!

00:03:32.254 --> 00:03:33.130
Princess...

00:03:33.755 --> 00:03:36.007
Goddamn crab.

00:03:36.174 --> 00:03:38.093
I'll blow your fucking head off!

00:03:38.301 --> 00:03:39.136
Cain...

00:03:41.138 --> 00:03:42.681
Oh, beg your pardon.

00:03:48.311 --> 00:03:49.730
Bounty hunters, huh?

00:03:50.063 --> 00:03:52.941
<i>I intercepted your transmission.</i>
<i>Need assistance?</i>

00:03:53.692 --> 00:03:54.776
What will it be?

00:03:55.026 --> 00:03:57.404
I trust your discretion
when it comes to the BRAI.

00:03:57.487 --> 00:03:58.321
Thank you.

00:03:58.989 --> 00:04:00.115
<i>How does 100 sound?</i>

00:04:00.657 --> 00:04:01.783
I don't need money.

00:04:02.075 --> 00:04:04.745
We'll settle payment after returning
to Neo Xianglong.

00:04:05.912 --> 00:04:07.789
Gigachalice class, Kankel Type.

00:04:07.956 --> 00:04:10.292
Armor rigidity on par with IM titanium.

00:04:10.542 --> 00:04:12.586
Presumed weak point is...

00:04:19.593 --> 00:04:21.720
Close combat with an Attacker, huh?

00:04:22.971 --> 00:04:25.056
We've pissed off another one.

00:04:32.939 --> 00:04:33.774
A kitty?

00:04:33.857 --> 00:04:35.650
<i>Shall we lend you a paw?</i>

00:04:36.318 --> 00:04:37.944
I'm a dog guy myself.

00:04:38.153 --> 00:04:39.279
I'll give you 100.

00:04:39.946 --> 00:04:42.115
<i>As long as you feed my partner, too.</i>

00:04:44.326 --> 00:04:46.161
Not bad from that range.

00:04:47.788 --> 00:04:50.415
We'll eat high on the hog tonight, Emilia.

00:04:51.416 --> 00:04:52.626
Not that it matters.

00:05:01.510 --> 00:05:02.677
<i>We're pulling back!</i>

00:05:20.278 --> 00:05:22.656
Estimated speed, 50 kilometers per hour.

00:05:22.781 --> 00:05:25.033
Intelligence recognized
in critical region five.

00:05:25.158 --> 00:05:26.576
-This quantum pattern
-Leon!

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:28.995
-and my hyperdrive data...
-Leon!

00:05:29.579 --> 00:05:31.832
The BRAI's evolution is accelerating
after all.

00:05:32.165 --> 00:05:35.210
-I need to complete this fast.
-Dang it, Leon!

00:05:39.464 --> 00:05:40.882
Chloe is angry.

00:05:41.174 --> 00:05:43.718
I can imagine
103 possible reasons for this.

00:05:43.802 --> 00:05:44.719
Reason one.

00:05:44.970 --> 00:05:46.388
I didn't brush my teeth.

00:05:46.680 --> 00:05:47.681
I brushed them.

00:05:47.764 --> 00:05:48.890
Reason two.

00:05:49.099 --> 00:05:50.600
I didn't wash my face.

00:05:51.017 --> 00:05:51.935
I washed it.

00:05:52.269 --> 00:05:54.354
Isn't today's experiment over?

00:05:54.729 --> 00:05:56.147
And did you forget Article 5?

00:05:56.982 --> 00:05:58.692
"No wandering around naked!"

00:06:03.572 --> 00:06:04.990
Reason 82.

00:06:05.282 --> 00:06:08.785
Dang it! Don't blame me
if you're stung by BRAI bees.

00:06:09.911 --> 00:06:12.747
The BRAI zapper is working.
There's nothing to worry about.

00:06:14.791 --> 00:06:17.168
What if I drop
the internal rotation resistance

00:06:17.294 --> 00:06:19.629
and electric current efficiency
as low as possible?

00:06:24.259 --> 00:06:26.219
Ouch!

00:06:26.678 --> 00:06:28.138
What a bumbling klutz.

00:06:29.306 --> 00:06:31.933
<i>I told you it was too dangerous</i>
<i>to go out there yourself.</i>

00:06:32.892 --> 00:06:36.021
I can't always rely
on machines and people, right?

00:06:44.195 --> 00:06:46.239
Allow me to use ABI rounds.

00:06:46.531 --> 00:06:47.657
Permission granted.

00:06:47.824 --> 00:06:49.326
Stop it with six or less.

00:06:49.451 --> 00:06:52.203
That's all?
We're facing two gigachalice class!

00:06:52.329 --> 00:06:53.997
We lost two guards.

00:06:54.205 --> 00:06:55.915
That's 13 this month alone.

00:06:56.082 --> 00:06:57.667
You can't get water from a stone.

00:06:57.792 --> 00:06:59.961
Use what we have effectively
to settle this.

00:07:00.378 --> 00:07:02.422
That is an order, Captain Gren.

00:07:04.633 --> 00:07:06.885
Does he want us to fight empty-handed?

00:07:07.552 --> 00:07:09.179
You want an entry pass?

00:07:09.262 --> 00:07:10.555
That's all?

00:07:10.764 --> 00:07:12.766
Yes. I want it fast.

00:07:12.933 --> 00:07:13.934
Cain.

00:07:14.809 --> 00:07:16.978
Queenie Yoh and Doug Horvat.

00:07:17.437 --> 00:07:18.813
Your IDs check out.

00:07:19.147 --> 00:07:21.066
-As for compensation--
-Rejected.

00:07:21.650 --> 00:07:24.903
Are you telling me I have to apply
for funds three days ahead of time?

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:28.406
Then you can't complain
if I hire them privately, right?

00:07:28.657 --> 00:07:29.908
What do you mean?

00:07:31.159 --> 00:07:33.995
Communications with one
of the food factories has been lost.

00:07:35.497 --> 00:07:37.624
<i>It was the work of that damn crab.</i>

00:07:39.584 --> 00:07:41.086
It's sure to return.

00:07:41.252 --> 00:07:43.630
I charge extra for optional services.

00:07:44.005 --> 00:07:45.256
Can I get fuel?

00:07:45.715 --> 00:07:47.926
Whatever happens, you're responsible.

00:07:48.259 --> 00:07:49.386
Roger.

00:07:56.476 --> 00:08:00.563
"Secretary to the Mayor of Neo Xianglong,
Jay Yoon."

00:08:02.691 --> 00:08:05.402
Nice to meet you, Secretary Jay.

00:08:06.695 --> 00:08:09.114
You will be held responsible! Understand?

00:08:09.906 --> 00:08:11.908
Roger. You got it.

00:08:18.039 --> 00:08:18.873
What is it?

00:08:18.957 --> 00:08:20.792
<i>Odd readings from the Suihoku sector.</i>

00:08:21.876 --> 00:08:23.169
Not him again.

00:08:23.712 --> 00:08:26.381
Dimensional vector difference
interference is normal.

00:08:26.506 --> 00:08:29.509
The observed probability
and integration trough were normal, too.

00:08:32.053 --> 00:08:33.930
All the requirements were fulfilled.

00:08:34.264 --> 00:08:36.266
What ignition factor is missing?

00:08:36.808 --> 00:08:38.935
What about the bike Mr. Wei
asked you to fix?

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:41.021
I'll do it later.

00:08:42.063 --> 00:08:44.899
Maybe strengthening the outer frame
and damper--

00:08:45.233 --> 00:08:48.445
Leon! You bought more parts
for that hyper whatever,

00:08:48.611 --> 00:08:50.739
so we're broke this month, you know!

00:08:51.906 --> 00:08:53.199
-Chloe...
-Darn you!

00:08:53.283 --> 00:08:55.577
Quit loafing around in power-save mode!

00:08:55.702 --> 00:08:58.663
If you keep on like this,
I'll tear up our family contract!

00:09:00.081 --> 00:09:01.166
I'm sorry.

00:09:01.458 --> 00:09:03.043
I promise to fix it later.

00:09:03.251 --> 00:09:05.170
Is this research that important?

00:09:05.545 --> 00:09:06.588
Yes.

00:09:08.214 --> 00:09:10.800
Humans can't keep up with
the evolution of the BRAI.

00:09:11.342 --> 00:09:14.095
There's no way to fight back
except with the hyperdrive.

00:09:14.262 --> 00:09:16.765
If you complete it,
we can defeat the BRAI?

00:09:17.307 --> 00:09:20.727
Theoretically, the power
and reaction speed of MOEVs

00:09:21.144 --> 00:09:23.813
will increase by a power of three.

00:09:25.106 --> 00:09:28.526
With a specialized machine,
the power could be increased even more.

00:09:29.611 --> 00:09:31.821
Do you really plan to fight the BRAI?

00:09:32.197 --> 00:09:33.114
Let's be real.

00:09:33.323 --> 00:09:34.532
I could never do it.

00:09:34.699 --> 00:09:36.701
I'd hand it over to Neo Xianglong.

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:39.245
They can fight off the BRAI with it

00:09:39.662 --> 00:09:43.124
while I perfect the control
of the quantum reactor.

00:09:44.459 --> 00:09:45.418
Neo Xianglong...

00:09:45.835 --> 00:09:49.756
Then I can work on my
personal research projects at my leisure.

00:09:50.173 --> 00:09:51.633
And Chloe, you can...

00:09:52.050 --> 00:09:52.967
Oh, boy.

00:09:53.384 --> 00:09:55.345
It's about time to charge up my energy.

00:09:55.595 --> 00:09:58.306
Oh, right.
I'm in charge of cooking dinner tonight.

00:09:59.099 --> 00:10:01.893
I'm pretty sure we've still got
barn and foxtail millet left.

00:10:02.185 --> 00:10:04.896
Maybe I'll boil that BRAI lobster
I caught the other day.

00:10:15.907 --> 00:10:17.534
I hope it works out today.

00:10:17.867 --> 00:10:20.537
First, I'll start a reaction
with chlorine and sodium

00:10:20.829 --> 00:10:22.413
to create sodium chloride.

00:10:34.425 --> 00:10:36.052
Don't force it!

00:10:36.594 --> 00:10:37.512
Give that here.

00:10:37.595 --> 00:10:39.514
Oh, but... Okay.

00:10:40.431 --> 00:10:45.103
Find the soft parts at the joints
and cut it like this.

00:10:50.817 --> 00:10:51.901
3.5 out of 10.

00:10:53.653 --> 00:10:55.613
At least it was edible this time.

00:10:58.950 --> 00:11:00.160
What's missing?

00:11:00.493 --> 00:11:02.245
Didn't the starch gel enough?

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:06.416
No. The gelling temperature
and water volume were perfect. Then...

00:11:06.624 --> 00:11:08.209
There's nothing missing.

00:11:08.459 --> 00:11:11.254
You just don't cook it for the flavor.

00:11:11.629 --> 00:11:13.089
That's not true.

00:11:13.464 --> 00:11:16.259
Though I'll admit my efforts
have been focused on finding

00:11:16.342 --> 00:11:19.721
a method of cooking that converts
our limited ingredients into energy.

00:11:23.391 --> 00:11:25.476
You plan on returning to Neo Xianglong?

00:11:26.185 --> 00:11:28.521
Well, they do have the quantum reactor.

00:11:29.564 --> 00:11:32.400
Those are the people who banished you.

00:11:32.692 --> 00:11:34.777
It was partly my fault, though.

00:11:35.236 --> 00:11:36.738
But that's no reason--

00:11:45.955 --> 00:11:47.582
<i>BRAI in the Suihoku sector?</i>

00:11:47.832 --> 00:11:51.127
<i>It's headed straight for Neo Xianglong.</i>

00:11:51.252 --> 00:11:52.670
That's his neck of the woods.

00:11:53.004 --> 00:11:55.256
Leon! This is bad! We're in trouble!

00:12:01.137 --> 00:12:02.180
<i>You two!</i>

00:12:03.139 --> 00:12:05.266
This place is about to see combat. Run!

00:12:06.017 --> 00:12:07.393
O-- Okay!

00:12:07.894 --> 00:12:10.438
Please keep the BRAI from coming this way.

00:12:10.772 --> 00:12:13.191
-Huh?!
-What a request.

00:12:13.608 --> 00:12:14.817
Anyway, get out now!

00:12:15.026 --> 00:12:16.653
Chloe, you get clear first!

00:12:16.945 --> 00:12:18.154
Where are you going?

00:12:18.446 --> 00:12:21.115
Give me a sitrep.
Are the ABI rounds ready?

00:12:21.366 --> 00:12:24.118
They're loaded on the commanders
and Units One and Two.

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:29.874
Where the hell are those
goddamn bounty hunters?

00:12:31.960 --> 00:12:33.086
She's insane!

00:12:41.678 --> 00:12:42.971
Hand-to-hand combat?!

00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:57.443
<i>Requesting permission to fire ABI rounds!</i>

00:12:57.527 --> 00:12:58.361
Granted.

00:12:58.444 --> 00:13:00.321
<i>Unit Two, fire ABI rounds!</i>

00:13:00.738 --> 00:13:01.572
Roger!

00:13:06.327 --> 00:13:07.328
Nice work!

00:13:07.412 --> 00:13:11.040
Now cut that fucker's pinchers off
and shove them right up his ass!

00:13:11.708 --> 00:13:13.626
-Cain.
-Oh, beg your pardon.

00:13:13.835 --> 00:13:15.086
You're done for!

00:13:17.922 --> 00:13:19.048
Crap...

00:13:27.932 --> 00:13:30.643
The hero's waiting to make his entrance?

00:13:31.019 --> 00:13:32.729
Doesn't matter to me though.

00:13:34.397 --> 00:13:36.941
<i>-Unit Two, fire ABI rounds!</i>
-Roger!

00:13:42.196 --> 00:13:43.990
<i>Spread out! Get some distance!</i>

00:13:44.949 --> 00:13:46.576
Unit Two has exploded.

00:13:46.951 --> 00:13:49.537
One ABI round, 200 million down the drain.

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:55.418
The hell?

00:14:16.689 --> 00:14:18.357
What do you think you're doing?

00:14:20.401 --> 00:14:21.402
Leon, look!

00:14:25.114 --> 00:14:26.949
Oh, not good! We're in trouble!

00:14:27.241 --> 00:14:28.159
It's fusing?

00:14:28.409 --> 00:14:30.495
It's adapting itself to enemy attackers?

00:14:30.703 --> 00:14:32.205
-What's this now?
-No way!

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:34.791
So, even among the BRAI, there is...

00:14:35.083 --> 00:14:36.667
Dark Chaos.

00:14:57.021 --> 00:14:59.565
Squad Seven! Spread out and counterattack!

00:15:01.317 --> 00:15:02.527
Come in, Unit One!

00:15:02.902 --> 00:15:07.031
Aim for the enemy's liquid launcher
and fire an ABI round into it!

00:15:07.281 --> 00:15:08.157
<i>Roger!</i>

00:15:10.618 --> 00:15:12.328
I'll turn you into crab stew!

00:15:12.912 --> 00:15:13.996
Fire!

00:15:22.547 --> 00:15:23.589
Retreat!

00:15:30.721 --> 00:15:31.556
Shit!

00:15:35.393 --> 00:15:36.644
Get out of here now!

00:15:51.367 --> 00:15:52.869
<i>-Captain!</i>
-Conrad!

00:15:53.369 --> 00:15:54.579
Conrad!

00:15:55.496 --> 00:15:57.999
-<i>Fuck!</i>
-Units Three and Seven, no response!

00:15:58.207 --> 00:16:01.669
Unit One, immobilized!
The BRAI's advance isn't stopping!

00:16:10.720 --> 00:16:13.097
Come on! What do you think you're doing?

00:16:15.808 --> 00:16:16.642
Here.

00:16:19.270 --> 00:16:21.355
The hyperdrive specs are on it.

00:16:22.148 --> 00:16:23.608
When this is completed someday,

00:16:23.941 --> 00:16:26.277
humans will be able to resist the BRAI.

00:16:27.111 --> 00:16:29.030
No, don't do this, Leon!

00:16:30.823 --> 00:16:32.700
I'm not going out there to die.

00:16:33.159 --> 00:16:35.203
I'll get near that thing, escape,

00:16:35.620 --> 00:16:37.663
then detonate the hyperdrive.

00:16:38.122 --> 00:16:40.374
You take that
and get out of here fast, Chloe.

00:16:40.625 --> 00:16:42.752
Don't be stupid! That's suicide!

00:16:47.882 --> 00:16:49.675
Family contract, Article 17.

00:16:49.884 --> 00:16:52.595
"No matter what happens,
I will protect Chloe."

00:16:55.097 --> 00:16:56.474
Thanks for everything.

00:16:57.767 --> 00:16:58.601
Leon!

00:17:00.061 --> 00:17:00.895
Okay.

00:17:04.649 --> 00:17:05.566
Leon!

00:17:07.735 --> 00:17:08.736
See you later.

00:17:11.948 --> 00:17:13.241
Starting main system.

00:17:13.908 --> 00:17:14.742
Audio input,

00:17:15.201 --> 00:17:16.369
AI assist on.

00:17:19.664 --> 00:17:20.623
Leon!

00:17:27.129 --> 00:17:30.633
Princess, we have no choice
but to use the Infinity Cannon.

00:17:34.136 --> 00:17:34.971
Princess!

00:17:35.096 --> 00:17:37.098
Detecting an unidentified vehicle.

00:17:37.807 --> 00:17:40.184
It's charging right at the giant BRAI.

00:17:40.560 --> 00:17:42.228
An unidentified vehicle?

00:17:42.311 --> 00:17:43.521
Do we have a visual?

00:17:49.026 --> 00:17:52.154
I never imagined
I would be driving this myself!

00:18:02.331 --> 00:18:04.333
Even with AI support,
I can't dodge them all!

00:18:14.010 --> 00:18:14.927
What the heck?

00:18:16.512 --> 00:18:17.888
Look at that piloting.

00:18:18.097 --> 00:18:19.140
Is he an amateur?

00:18:19.765 --> 00:18:20.600
Could it be...

00:18:24.812 --> 00:18:25.646
Leon!

00:18:27.732 --> 00:18:29.191
I have to get closer!

00:18:30.985 --> 00:18:31.819
This light...

00:18:32.778 --> 00:18:34.697
The hyperdrive stabilized?

00:18:35.239 --> 00:18:36.699
Interference rate, normal.

00:18:36.782 --> 00:18:39.118
Dimensional accumulation rate
is actually critical?!

00:18:39.577 --> 00:18:42.413
This is it!
I've found whatever was missing.

00:18:42.622 --> 00:18:44.165
What was the final factor?

00:18:47.752 --> 00:18:48.586
Leon!

00:18:48.753 --> 00:18:50.921
No! Leon!

00:19:00.640 --> 00:19:01.766
<i>I must protect her!</i>

00:19:02.975 --> 00:19:04.101
<i>I must protect her!</i>

00:19:04.977 --> 00:19:05.895
<i>I must!</i>

00:19:08.773 --> 00:19:11.901
I've got it!
What was missing was a person.

00:19:12.360 --> 00:19:14.028
The final ignition factor...

00:19:14.737 --> 00:19:16.656
was me!

00:19:27.625 --> 00:19:28.501
Leon!

00:19:49.105 --> 00:19:51.399
The hyperdrive has achieved
multidimensionality!

00:19:51.482 --> 00:19:52.733
It's gone critical!

00:19:52.817 --> 00:19:54.568
It works! It works!

00:19:57.530 --> 00:19:59.031
Terraroid formation!

00:20:06.122 --> 00:20:06.956
It's flying?

00:20:07.289 --> 00:20:08.332
You're kidding!

00:20:16.132 --> 00:20:17.133
The worlds are...

00:20:17.633 --> 00:20:19.009
converging!

00:20:39.572 --> 00:20:40.698
That Attacker...

00:20:40.990 --> 00:20:41.949
It changed to...

00:20:42.366 --> 00:20:43.284
Humanoid form?

00:20:43.367 --> 00:20:46.120
-No, it evolved!
<i>-Picking up quantum readings.</i>

00:20:47.371 --> 00:20:48.748
White Chaos.

00:20:58.924 --> 00:21:00.843
Leon? Is that you?

00:21:04.305 --> 00:21:05.848
Stay away from Chloe!

00:21:22.782 --> 00:21:24.074
Multidimensional

00:21:24.658 --> 00:21:28.204
Attack!

00:21:48.307 --> 00:21:49.475
Brother...

00:21:55.523 --> 00:21:56.398
Was that...

00:21:57.483 --> 00:21:59.193
the power of the hyperdrive?

00:22:01.612 --> 00:22:03.239
<i>What are your intentions...</i>

00:22:04.073 --> 00:22:04.949
<i>Leon Lau?</i>

00:22:05.866 --> 00:22:06.867
<i>You, who...</i>

00:22:07.785 --> 00:22:09.453
<i>brought the world to ruin.</i>

00:23:46.800 --> 00:23:50.095
NEXT
THE OPENER OF THE BOX

00:23:50.179 --> 00:23:51.930
